            "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope",
            "notes": "EIP-7702 allows code delegation for EOAs. Weak authorization validation enables account takeover."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Identify the nonce validation logic for EIP-7702 authorizations in the execution engine.\n2. Submit an authorization with an already-used nonce and verify it is rejected.\n3. Submit an authorization with a future nonce and verify correct handling per specification.\n4. Test authorization replay by resubmitting a previously successful authorization and confirm rejection.\n5. Verify that nonce is included in the authorization signing hash.\n6. Check for race conditions where multiple transactions might use the same authorization nonce.",
          "bug_class": "Input Validation",
