              "Deposit contract address verification",
              "Event signature verification"
            ],
            "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope",
            "notes": "A malicious contract could emit logs mimicking the deposit event signature at a different address."
          },
          "test_procedure": "1. Trace the data flow from block/transaction ingestion to deposit event parsing within the execution client.\n2. Identify all code paths where log events are processed and verify each path includes address validation.\n3. Check that there are no bypass paths (e.g., debug endpoints, internal APIs) that skip the address check.\n4. Verify that the execution client does not cache or trust previously validated addresses without re-verification.\n5. Test concurrent transaction processing to ensure address validation cannot be bypassed via race conditions.",
